{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AnyOf","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule5AnyOfV","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AnyOf","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"QueryTerm.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm.swift#L112"},"role":"symbol","title":"AnyOf"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"A group of types an entity matches by matching at least one of them.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/anyof"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/FilterTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s15BitwiseCopyableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Querying and Updating Entities","generated":true,"anchor":"Querying-and-Updating-Entities","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityQueryView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryRow","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntitiesView"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AnyOf","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As a term of a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnyOf"},{"type":"text","text":" of component types matches the entities that hold at least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one of the types, and reads a tuple with one optional per type: the entity’s component, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" where the entity lacks that type. Use it to visit entities that may carry any of several"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"related components:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Name(value: \"frozen comet\"), Velocity(dx: 4, dy: 0), Frozen())","world.spawn(Name(value: \"comet\"), Velocity(dx: 2, dy: 0))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"ice\"), Frozen())","world.spawn(Name(value: \"rock\"))","","var descriptions: [String] = []","for (_, name, (velocity, frozen)) in world.query(Query(Name.self, AnyOf<Velocity, Frozen>.self)) {","    let state = frozen == nil ? \"moving at \\(velocity?.dx ?? 0)\" : \"frozen\"","    descriptions.append(\"\\(name.value) is \\(state)\")","}","print(descriptions)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"frozen comet is frozen\", \"comet is moving at 2.0\", \"ice is frozen\"]\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rock holds neither type, so the query skips it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"As a filter type of a system’s query (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/Where","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnyOf"},{"text":" of filter types passes the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entities that pass at least one of them: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Query<Health>.Where<AnyOf<Changed<Health>, Without<Frozen>>>"},{"text":" visits the entities whose health changed and the ones that aren’t frozen.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Queries of one to three terms, with ","type":"text"},{"code":"AnyOf","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" groups of two to four types, run through code","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specialized for their exact shape.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf\/FilterTerm-Implementations","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf\/QueryTerm-Implementations"]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/EntitiesView":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"EntitiesView","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntitiesView","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/entitiesview","abstract":[{"text":"A sequence of the live entities of a world, in slot order.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EntitiesView","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntitiesView"},"doc://WorldModule/s8CopyableP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Copyable","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8CopyableP"},"doc://WorldModule/s9Esca